    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Exams frequently ask about the functional units of major body systems (e.g., neurons in the nervous system, nephrons in the excretory system).",
        "Compare the rapid, short-term electrical response of the Nervous System with the slower, long-lasting chemical action of the Endocrine System.",
        "Be prepared to identify organs associated with specific human body systems and their primary physiological roles."
